</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931023552.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931023552.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">骄阳砺少年，迷彩铸锋芒</span><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团2026级新生</span><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以热血赴淬炼，以笃行赴新程</span><span style="color: black;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">近</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日，绍兴一中教育集团2026级新生军训结营仪式暨总结表彰大会隆重举行，全体新生圆满收官为期七日的军训</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">之旅</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委副书记、校长蒋明，纪委书记、副校长杨佩琼，副校长朱水军，副校长冯王亮，绍兴市教育局专职督学任联君，党委委员、龙山</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校区副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">裘东</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">龙山</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校区副校长祝智浩</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，东浦街道人武部部长凌铁钢出席本次仪式，全体高一师生、军训教官共同见证</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同学们的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蜕变时刻。仪式由德育处负责人马丹娜主持。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、启幕：列阵展姿，砺兵致远</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次大会在庄严的国歌</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">声</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中正式拉开帷幕。各连队列队整齐，全体学子精神抖擞，嘹亮的口号声响彻全场，尽显经过军训淬炼后的昂扬风貌与强大集体向心力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、汇演：步履铿锵，不负淬炼</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各连队依次列队前行，方阵彰显担当。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">整齐的步伐沉稳有力，挺拔的身姿意气风发。立正稍息、跨立看齐、列队转体，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各项动作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">行云流水，展现了同学们良好的精神</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">风</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">貌。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、寄语：以训砺志，笃行成长</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一年管会主任祝智浩</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为本次军训作总结致辞。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">复盘本次军训全过程，赞许同学们在严苛训练中不断突破自我、完成蜕变。同时，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向悉心带</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">训的全体教官，全程陪伴的班主任团队以及默默付出的后勤工作人员致以诚挚的感谢。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四、表彰：定格高光，致敬拼搏</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">汗水浇灌荣光，拼搏收获嘉奖。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">由</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杨佩琼副校长宣读各项荣誉的获奖名单，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校级领</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">导依次上台</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为荣获“优秀连队”“内务优胜班级”“军训标兵”“救护标兵”等荣誉的集体和个人颁奖。一张张奖状、一份份荣誉，是对拼搏</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精神</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的肯定，现场热烈的掌声此起彼伏。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五、收官：迷彩落幕，新程启航</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次军训坚持训</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">育</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相融的育人理念，不</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仅</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有烈日下的意志磨砺，更有多元的特色活动</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">让学子在健体、知学、明理中淬炼成长。基础军事知识讲座夯实国防认知；国防科技大学教授带来专题科普课堂，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">揭</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">秘电磁科技奥秘；消防安全教育培训</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">实操</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">理论结合，筑牢安全防护意识；合唱比赛唱响红色经典，赓续长征精神。系列活动与军事训练相辅相成，真正实现体能锤炼、思想淬炼、知识赋能、品格塑造全方位成长。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">七日迷彩时光，军训的烈日磨砺了少年心性。褪去青涩稚气，收获坚韧担当，这段滚烫的军训时光，终将成为同学们高中生涯最珍贵的开篇记忆。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">愿2026级全体一中学子以更昂扬的姿态奔赴崭新的高中征程，逐光而行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向阳生长！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.31in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 11pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931356548.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931356548.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030932093916.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030932093916.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931415486.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931415486.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931466834.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931466834.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931463566.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931463566.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931508709.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931508709.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030932014996.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030932014996.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931507748.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931507748.png" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931541276.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931541276.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/9/202609030931586940.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202609030931586940.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/UploadFiles/xwzx/